<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v3"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2756055671"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1843574534"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="MIDDLE NOTE"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="鷲尾伶菜 / KAZ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="MIDDLE NOTE"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:03.867"><div begin="00:11.530" end="02:49.217"><p begin="00:11.530" end="00:16.403" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">貴方に嫌われるとわかってるのにいつも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明知会被你讨厌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ni ki ra wa re ru to</span></p><p begin="00:16.803" end="00:21.778" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">SNSにヘラって呟いてごめん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">发些自怨自艾的言论 实在抱歉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">SNS ni he ra 't te tsu bu ya i te go me n</span></p><p begin="00:21.879" end="00:26.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">ひねくれた想いが止まらないの、どうして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">扭曲的情绪翻涌在心间停不下来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ne ku re ta o mo i ga to ma ra na i no</span></p><p begin="00:27.075" end="00:31.851" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">私がいなくても平気でいられるの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟为何</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ga i na ku te mo he i ki de i ra re ru no ？</span></p><p begin="00:32.453" end="00:37.186" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">(私らしくない) 貴方がくれた香水も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(根本就不像我)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( wa ta shi ra shi ku na i )</span></p><p begin="00:37.637" end="00:43.621" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">(嫌いになる前に) 離れた方がいいの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(趁你还没厌恶我)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( ki ra i ni na ru ma e ni )</span></p><p begin="00:44.288" end="00:45.008" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">無理<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">做不到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ri</span></p><p begin="00:45.448" end="00:47.576" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">100個 "嫌い" になっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕列出100个“讨厌”的理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hya 'k ko “ ki ra i ” ni na 't te mo</span></p><p begin="00:48.069" end="00:50.176" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">貴方に敵わないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可终究还是敌不过你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ni ka na wa na i no</span></p><p begin="00:50.609" end="00:52.736" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">101個目の "好き" が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">第101个“喜欢”的理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hya ku i 'k ko me no “ su ki ” ga</span></p><p begin="00:52.736" end="00:55.298" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">追い寄せてまた沼らせるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍会将我重新拖回爱的泥潭中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o i yo se te ma ta nu ma ra se ru no</span></p><p begin="00:55.693" end="00:58.375" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">I love you (大好きなの)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你 (如此深爱你)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I love you ( da i su ki na no )</span></p><p begin="00:58.287" end="01:01.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">I need you (まだ好きなの)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我需要你 (还是喜欢你)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I need you ( ma da su ki na no )</span></p><p begin="01:00.917" end="01:03.434" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">I still love you (私のせい)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍旧爱你 (都是我的错)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I still love you ( wa ta shi no se i )</span></p><p begin="01:03.452" end="01:04.802" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">ずるいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">实在是狡猾</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu ru i yo</span></p><p begin="01:11.191" end="01:16.142" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L16">僕の汚いとこも、残酷さも全部<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我肮脏的劣根性还有残酷的本质</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku no ki ta na i to ko mo za n ko ku sa mo ze n bu</span></p><p begin="01:16.410" end="01:21.243" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L17">"綺麗だ" って包み込んでくれたのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你全都用一句“好帅气”而选择包容接纳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ ki re i da ” 't te tsu tsu mi ko n de ku re ta no ni</span></p><p begin="01:21.543" end="01:26.624" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L18">好きなバニラのフレーバーそれすら重くなって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我喜欢的那阵香草气息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki na ba ni ra no fu re e ba a</span></p><p begin="01:26.830" end="01:31.664" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L19">君の甘さに耐えきれないよ、ダサいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不堪承受你的那份甜蜜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no a ma sa ni ta e ki re na i yo</span></p><p begin="01:32.181" end="01:36.864" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L20">(君らしくないよ) 僕色には染まらないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(实在是很不像你)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( ki mi ra shi ku na i yo )</span></p><p begin="01:37.264" end="01:45.586" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L21">(嫌いになりなよ) 幸せにできないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(快点变得讨厌我)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( ki ra i ni na ri na yo )</span></p><p begin="01:47.727" end="01:49.843" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L22">100回嫌われても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕被讨厌100次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hya 'k ka i ki ra wa re te mo</span></p><p begin="01:50.341" end="01:52.509" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L23">君を笑顔にできる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依然能让你展露笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wo e ga o ni de ki ru</span></p><p begin="01:52.906" end="01:55.963" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L24">101回好きにさせられる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你101次重新感到心动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hya ku i 'k ka i su ki ni sa se ra re ru</span></p><p begin="01:55.963" end="01:57.646" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L25">僕だったらな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是我就可以</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku da 't ta ra na</span></p><p begin="01:57.947" end="02:00.914" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L26">I love you (I love you)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你 (我爱你)</span></p><p begin="02:00.504" end="02:03.675" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L27">I need you (I need you)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我需要你 (我需要你)</span></p><p begin="02:03.005" end="02:05.873" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L28">I still love you (I still love you)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍旧爱你 (我仍旧爱你)</span></p><p begin="02:08.482" end="02:10.632" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">秋に忘れ物して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">秋日的遗忘之物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ki ni wa su re mo no shi te</span></p><p begin="02:11.066" end="02:13.216" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">冬の香りがしないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并未散发冬日的气息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu yu no ka o ri ga shi na i no</span></p><p begin="02:13.666" end="02:17.767" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">枯れ落ちた葉のようにまだそこにいるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恍若枯萎凋零的落叶般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka re o chi ta ha no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:29.266" end="02:31.368" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L32">100個 "嫌い" になっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕列出100个“讨厌”的理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hya 'k ko “ ki ra i ” ni na 't te mo</span></p><p begin="02:31.845" end="02:33.984" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L33">貴方に敵わないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可终究还是敌不过你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ni ka na wa na i no</span></p><p begin="02:34.385" end="02:36.539" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L34">101個目の "好き" が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">第101个“喜欢”的理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hya ku i 'k ko me no “ su ki ” ga</span></p><p begin="02:36.539" end="02:39.104" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L35">追い寄せてまた沼らせるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍会将我重新拖回爱的泥潭中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o i yo se te ma ta nu ma ra se ru no</span></p><p begin="02:39.475" end="02:41.941" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L36">I love you (大好きだよ)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你 (如此深爱你)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I love you ( da i su ki da yo )</span></p><p begin="02:42.062" end="02:44.623" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L37">I need you (まだ好きだよ)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我需要你 (还是喜欢你)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I need you ( ma da su ki da yo )</span></p><p begin="02:44.623" end="02:47.413" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L38">I still love you (ごめんね)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍旧爱你 (实在对不起)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I still love you ( go me n ne )</span></p><p begin="02:47.568" end="02:49.217" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Bye-bye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见了</span></p></div></body></tt>